[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 95 Tickets, please.",
    "start": 0.99,
    "end": 5.071,
    "zh": "第95课 请出示车票。",
    "zh_hant": "第95課 請出示車票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.471,
    "end": 11.032,
    "zh": "听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Why did George and Ken miss the train?",
    "start": 12.496,
    "end": 16.618,
    "zh": "为什么乔治和肯错过了火车？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼喬治和肯錯過了火車？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Two return tickets to London, please.",
    "start": 19.32,
    "end": 22.841,
    "zh": "请买两张去伦敦的往返票。",
    "zh_hant": "請買兩張去倫敦的往返票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What time will the next train leave?",
    "start": 23.422,
    "end": 26.743,
    "zh": "下一班火车什么时候开？",
    "zh_hant": "下一班火車什麼時候開？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "At nineteen minutes past eight.",
    "start": 27.224,
    "end": 30.185,
    "zh": "八点十九分。",
    "zh_hant": "八點十九分。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Which platform?",
    "start": 31.486,
    "end": 33.006,
    "zh": "哪个站台？",
    "zh_hant": "哪個站臺？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Two.",
    "start": 34.127,
    "end": 34.887,
    "zh": "二号站台。",
    "zh_hant": "二號站臺。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Over the bridge.",
    "start": 35.148,
    "end": 36.748,
    "zh": "过桥。",
    "zh_hant": "過橋。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What time will the next train leave?",
    "start": 38.169,
    "end": 41.351,
    "zh": "下一班火车什么时候开？",
    "zh_hant": "下一班火車什麼時候開？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "At eight nineteen.",
    "start": 42.132,
    "end": 44.312,
    "zh": "八点十九分。",
    "zh_hant": "八點十九分。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "We've got plenty of time.",
    "start": 44.933,
    "end": 47.594,
    "zh": "我们时间很充裕。",
    "zh_hant": "我們時間很充裕。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "It's only three minutes to eight.",
    "start": 48.535,
    "end": 51.776,
    "zh": "现在才差三分钟到八点。",
    "zh_hant": "現在才差三分鐘到八點。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Let's go and have a drink.",
    "start": 52.497,
    "end": 55.098,
    "zh": "我们去喝一杯吧。",
    "zh_hant": "我們去喝一杯吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "There's a bar next door to the station.",
    "start": 55.458,
    "end": 59.44,
    "zh": "车站旁边有个酒吧。",
    "zh_hant": "車站旁邊有個酒吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "We had better go back to the station now, Ken.",
    "start": 60.641,
    "end": 64.822,
    "zh": "肯，我们现在最好回车站去。",
    "zh_hant": "肯，我們現在最好回車站去。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Tickets, please.",
    "start": 65.723,
    "end": 67.484,
    "zh": "请出示车票。",
    "zh_hant": "請出示車票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "We want to catch the eight nineteen to London.",
    "start": 68.244,
    "end": 72.466,
    "zh": "我们想赶八点十九分去伦敦的火车。",
    "zh_hant": "我們想趕八點十九分去倫敦的火車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "You've just missed it!",
    "start": 72.807,
    "end": 75.067,
    "zh": "你们刚错过了！",
    "zh_hant": "你們剛錯過了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "What!",
    "start": 75.628,
    "end": 76.548,
    "zh": "什么！",
    "zh_hant": "什麼！"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It's only eight fifteen.",
    "start": 77.009,
    "end": 79.81,
    "zh": "现在才八点十五分。",
    "zh_hant": "現在才八點十五分。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I'm sorry, sir.",
    "start": 80.312,
    "end": 82.094,
    "zh": "对不起，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "對不起，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "That clock's ten minutes slow.",
    "start": 82.195,
    "end": 85.24,
    "zh": "那个钟慢了十分钟。",
    "zh_hant": "那個鐘慢了十分鐘。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "When's the next train?",
    "start": 86.182,
    "end": 88.325,
    "zh": "下一班火车什么时候？",
    "zh_hant": "下一班火車什麼時候？"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "In five hours' time!",
    "start": 88.766,
    "end": 91.25,
    "zh": "五个小时之后！",
    "zh_hant": "五個小時之後！"
  }
]
